    "confirmed_promotional_credit": "$0",
    "confirmed_annual_fee": "Not available",
    "expected_net_return": "$4,000 minus the Business Platinum annual fee"
  },
  "recommendation_status": "The Business Platinum card remains the strongest candidate if Apple Music posts under the eligible Media category, but I cannot provide a fully numeric net return or confirm that it is definitively the best option without the card's annual fee.",
  "next_step": "Confirm the Business Platinum annual fee in the application disclosures or with a commercial lending specialist before applying. Do not rely on the $4,000 figure as the net return until that fee is known."
}
